        "content": {
          "parts": [
            {
              "text": "Adelaide’s prestige residential market—centered across historic eastern and inner-southern pockets (such as Medindie, Unley Park, Walkerville, Rose Park, and Springfield) as well as prime coastal strips (such as Glenelg and Tennyson)—is dominated by a select group of boutique and established agencies, alongside specialized auctioneers.\n\n---\n\n### **Leading Luxury Real Estate Agencies & Agents**\n\n#### **1. Booth Real Estate (Led by Jamie Brown)**\n* **Market Position:** Unrivaled when it comes to setting state residential price benchmarks. \n* **Profile:** Jamie Brown is considered Adelaide’s preeminent agent for trophy homes, historic estates, and record-setting beachfronts. He has held multiple South Australian price records, including landmark sales in **Medindie**, **Unley Park** (e.g., Victoria Avenue estates), **Gilberton**, and the **Glenelg foreshore**. The firm specializes in discreet, often off-market campaigns tailored for ultra-high-net-worth buyers.\n\n#### **2. Williams Real Estate (Williams Luxury – Stephanie & John Williams)**\n* **Market Position:** A dominant market leader for modern architectural luxury, premium lifestyle homes, and prime coastal properties.\n* **Profile:** Stephanie Williams is consistently recognized among South Australia’s top-selling agents by total luxury volume. Known for high-production marketing campaigns, styling presentation, and a client network spanning interstate and international expatriates, Williams Real Estate frequently handles major listings across the inner east, Adelaide Hills lifestyle enclaves, and waterfront suburbs.\n\n#### **3. TOOP+TOOP Real Estate**\n* **Market Position:** One of South Australia’s most awarded independent agencies, with deep roots in Adelaide’s eastern and city-fringe prestige sectors.\n* **Profile:** TOOP+TOOP is notable for combining high-volume capability with an elite sales and auction team. Lead agents like **Sally Cameron** consistently rank among the state’s highest-grossing residential sales performers, regularly transacting multi-million-dollar character homes in Toorak Gardens, North Adelaide, and Rose Park.\n\n#### **4. Harris Real Estate**\n* **Market Position:** One of South Australia’s largest independent real estate businesses, with a dedicated high-end division.\n* **Profile:** Founded by Phil Harris, the agency operates extensively across the eastern suburbs, inner south, and premium coastal markets. Their prestige division leverages extensive digital distribution and in-house auction capabilities to generate competitive tension for landmark properties.\n\n#### **5. Klemich Real Estate**\n* **Market Position:** A boutique eastern suburbs heritage powerhouse.\n* **Profile:** Long established in the inner east (Burnside, Norwood, Dulwich, Unley), principals such as **Matt Smith** and founder **Oren Klemich** have managed high-end residential sales for decades, maintaining an extensive database of local generational wealth.\n\n#### **6. Giordano & Partners Luxury Real Estate**\n* **Market Position:** Boutique agency solely dedicated to the luxury, architectural, and heritage segment.\n* **Profile:** Focuses on bespoke marketing for mansions, lifestyle estates, and design-led properties, catering primarily to high-net-worth individuals and international clientele.\n\n---\n\n### **Top-Performing Auctioneers for Prestige Properties**\n\nAuctions are a preferred method of sale in Adelaide's premium inner suburbs, making top-tier auctioneers critical to extracting maximum value on sale day.\n\n* **Bronte Manuel (TOOP+TOOP):** Widely regarded as South Australia’s benchmark auctioneer. Manuel is a multi-time winner of the prestigious **Society of Auctioneers and Appraisers Golden Gavel Championship** (including wins in 2014, 2023, 2024, 2025, and 2026) and a regular South Australian representative at the Australasian Auctioneering Championships. He is the go-to caller for headline-making luxury auctions across Adelaide.\n* **John Morris (Morris Auctions):** A leading independent freelance auctioneer who has won the SA **Top Auctioneer of the Year** award repeatedly for the highest volume of successful auction clearances. Morris regularly partners with top luxury agents to call high-pressure on-site and in-room prestige auctions.\n* **Phil Harris (Harris Real Estate):** Beyond leading his agency, Phil Harris is a past Golden Gavel winner and an accomplished auctioneer known for high-stakes, energetic calls on blue-chip properties.\n* **Anthony Toop AM (TOOP+TOOP):** The founder of the Golden Gavel competition in 1993, Anthony Toop remains an icon of Adelaide's property auction scene.\n* **Glenn McMillan & Stefan Krcmarov (TOOP+TOOP):** Prominent rising talents in the auctioneering circuit, with McMillan holding Golden Gavel honors and Krcmarov competing at the Australasian level. Both are heavily utilized in premium residential transactions.",
              "thoughtSignature": ""
            }
          ],
